                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this tradition makes a melee attack:
- Unless the target of that attack contains any VEHICLE or MONSTER models, re-roll a wound roll of 1.
- If the target of that attack contained 6 or models when this model was selected to fight, you can re-roll the wound roll.</characteristic>
