                    <characteristic name="Troth." typeId="1912-abcd-fd39-6144">At the end of your turn, you control less objective markers than you did at the start of your turn.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Honoured Ability, active with 1+ Honour points." typeId="2be7-b9eb-05a1-18ed">At the start of your Command phase, you gain 1 Command Point.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Virtuous Ability, active with 5+ Honour points." typeId="ca4a-a2a2-76dd-5c30">IMPERIAL KNIGHTS models of this Detachment have the Objective Secured ability. 
If a model already has this ability, each remaining wound of that model counts as 3 wounds instead of 2 when determining control of an objective marker.</characteristic>
