            <profile name="Canis Rex" id="1440-8bf3-9f04-e0c7" hidden="false" typeId="b3a8-0452-7436-44d1" typeName="Transport">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">This model can transport 1 Sir Hekhtur model. 
Sir Hekhtur model must be embarked in this transport at the begining of the battle, and cannot disembark unless this transport is destroyed.
While this transport have embarked Sir Hekhtur, is considered to have the CHARACTER Keyword.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Chainbreaker" id="6ed4-83cd-74cd-bea9" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time CANIS REX makes an attack against a non-IMPERIUM unit, on an unmodified hit roll of 6, one additional hit is scored.
In addition, each time CANIS REX is about to lose a wound, roll a D6, on a unmodified roll of 6 the wound is not lost.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
