        <profile name="Errant’s Duty (Bondsman)" id="c99f-6dee-fe77-8fa7" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, you can select one friendly &lt;NOBLE HOUSEHOLD&gt; ARMIGER-CLASS model within 12&quot; of this model. 
Until the start of your next Command phase, that ARMIGER-CLASS model is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it advanced, and you add 1 to Advance and Charge rolls made for that ARMIGER-CLASS model.</characteristic>
