        <profile name="Warden’s Duty (Bondsman)" id="45d2-2a36-9dc0-12e8" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, you can select one friendly &lt;NOBLE HOUSEHOLD&gt; ARMIGER-CLASS model within 12&quot; of this model. 
Until the startof your next Command phase, that ARMIGER-CLASS model&apos;s wounds counts thrice instead of twice for the purposes of determining which player controls objective markers.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
