          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model is selected to shoot or fight, you can re-roll one hit roll, one wound roll or one damage roll when resolving that model’s attacks.</characteristic>
