                <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this weapon profile, make 3 hit rolls instead of 1. Each time an attack is made with this weapon profile, on an unmodified wound roll of 6, the target suffers 1 mortal wound in addition to the normal damage.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
