            <profile name="The Heart of Ion" id="e502-3595-30d2-da94" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per turn, at the end of your Command phase, the bearer can use this Relic. 
When it does, the bearer suffers D3 mortal wounds, and you must select one ranged weapon that the bearer is equipped with, and until the start of your next Command phase:
- Add 1&quot; to the bearers Move characteristic.
- Add 1 to Advance and charge rolls made for the bearer.
- Each time the bearer makes an attack with the selected weapon, add 1 to that attack’s wound roll.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
