              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, you can select one other friendly &lt;NOBLE HOUSEHOLD&gt; ARMIGER-CLASS model within 12&quot; of this model. 
Until the start of your next Command phase, each time that ARMIGER-CLASS model makes an attack, add 1 to that attack’s wound roll.</characteristic>
